  "description_short": "Pharmacy with a quick-service cafe offering light meals, sandwiches, and coffee for shoppers on the go.",
  "description_long": "Located in the Garden Route Mall, this Dis-Chem branch includes a convenient cafe counter where you can grab a quick bite while running errands. The menu focuses on practical options like toasted sandwiches, wraps, salads, and fresh pastries, alongside reliable coffee and cold drinks.\n\nIt's a functional stop rather than a destination dining experience—ideal for a fast lunch between shopping or before hitting the road. The mall location means easy parking and access to other shops, making it a convenient choice when you need something quick and no-fuss in George.",
